ordings answer every note.\n\nWhen a lesson starts, the curtain dissolves into light and a neon stage opens up. Notes fly out of a brass bell as glowing cubes: play the right note on the beat and your blade cuts them. A live staff shows the note to play and the note you played.\n\n\u2022 75 lessons in five paths: fundamentals, songs, technique, scales and improvisation\n\u2022 Listen to a demo first, slow it down, earn points, stars and streaks\n\u2022 Note study: all 31 fingerings with a reference sound and practice rounds\n\u2022 Free play with an adjustable metronome\n\u2022 Touch controllers or hand tracking, right or left handed: one hand presses the three valves, the other hand's distance from your face picks the register\n\u2022 Written pitch for B flat trumpet, note names as C D E or Do Re Mi\n\u2022 English, Portuguese, Spanish, French, German, Japanese and Chinese\n\nWorks offline. No account, no ads. Your progress stays on your headset.", "short_description": "Play a golden trumpet in VR and learn with 75 lessons on a neon stage that opens in your studio."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://a4tech.ai/trumpet/quest/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "A4 Tech Ltda", "support_website_url": "https://a4tech.ai/trumpet/quest/support/", "website_url": "https://a4tech.ai/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_mod